  "batch_id": "rahman-mariza-njpac-2026-08-25-discovery",
  "notes": "Verified Newark discoveries under the current two-stage RADAR rubric after rereading docs/PRIORITIES.md, docs/EDITORIAL.md, docs/DOMAINS.md, and radar/inbox/README.md. The Yamamoto-first pass checked ALFIE, BODY&SOUL, current Yamamoto listings, Space M&A and Japanese jazz sources and found no new unrecorded verified Tsuyoshi Yamamoto date. A.R. Rahman with the New Jersey Symphony and Mariza with Derek Gripper & Duo Andalus each clear RADAR admission for a specific musical context and are graded A+ rather than S because both offer multiple or touring opportunities rather than genuine scarcity.",
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "ar-rahman-new-jersey-symphony-njpac-2026-11-03",
      "artist": "A.R. Rahman with the New Jersey Symphony",
      "subtitle": "The Symphonic Experience",
