        "New Jersey Symphony — orchestra; conductor and additional guest personnel not announced on the NJPAC event page"
      ],
      "factual_description": "NJPAC and the New Jersey Symphony present A.R. Rahman: The Symphonic Experience in Prudential Hall on Tuesday, November 3 and Wednesday, November 4, 2026, both at 7:30 PM. NJPAC describes the program as Rahman's film and popular repertoire spanning works associated with Roja, Bombay, Dil Se, Taal, Lagaan, Jodhaa Akbar, Ponniyin Selvan, Slumdog Millionaire and 127 Hours, with the New Jersey Symphony joining Rahman to expand music that crosses Eastern classical, pop, world-music and rap vocabularies. Ticketmaster independently confirms both Newark dates and the 7:30 PM start time; member presale begins August 26 and general sale begins August 28, 2026. The specific conductor and any additional soloists or vocalists have not been announced on the Newark event page.",
      "links": {
        "official_event": "https://www.njpac.org/event/a-r-rahman/",
        "official_tickets": null
      },
      "recommended_listening": [
        {
          "artist": "A.R. Rahman",
          "title": "Bombay (Original Soundtrack) [OST]",
          "kind": "album",
          "apple_music_url": "https://music.apple.com/us/album/bombay-original-soundtrack-ost/1442492180"
        }
      ],
      "enrichment": {
        "status": "partial",
        "missing": [
          "official_tickets"
        ],
        "note": "NJPAC's exact event page, both dates/times and the exact Apple Music listening page are verified. Ticketmaster has separate authorized event pages for November 3 and November 4; the canonical single official_tickets field is left pending rather than making one night's purchase URL stand in for the two-night engagement. No conductor or unannounced guest personnel were inferred."
      },
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.njpac.org/event/a-r-rahman/",
          "publisher": "NJPAC",
          "checked_on": "2026-08-25",
          "note": "Official event page confirms November 3-4, 2026 at 7:30 PM in Prudential Hall, the New Jersey Symphony collaboration and the genre-spanning symphonic program around Rahman's film repertoire."
        },
        {
          "url": "https://www.ticketmaster.com/ar-rahman-the-symphonic-experience-newark-new-jersey-11-03-2026/event/00006513A473CCBA",
          "publisher": "Ticketmaster",
          "checked_on": "2026-08-25",
          "note": "Authorized ticket page for the November 3 function confirms 7:30 PM at NJPAC and sale windows beginning August 26, 2026."
        },
        {
          "url": "https://www.ticketmaster.com/ar-rahman-the-symphonic-experience-newark-new-jersey-11-04-2026/event/00006513A477CCCF",
          "publisher": "Ticketmaster",
          "checked_on": "2026-08-25",
          "note": "Authorized ticket page for the November 4 function independently confirms 7:30 PM at NJPAC and the same symphonic billing."
        },
        {
          "url": "https://music.apple.com/us/album/bombay-original-soundtrack-ost/1442492180",
          "publisher": "Apple Music",
          "checked_on": "2026-08-25",
          "note": "Exact Apple Music album page for Bombay, a useful compact example of Rahman's orchestral, electronic, vocal and Indian-classical synthesis."
        }
      ],
      "provenance": {
        "status": "verified-authoritative-sources",
        "note": "Date, time, venue, symphonic billing and program framing were verified against NJPAC; separate Ticketmaster event pages independently verify both Newark functions and authorized sale timing. Repository search found no A.R. Rahman RADAR record or matching event ID before publication. No conductor, vocalists, additional soloists, prices or repertoire beyond the official program description were inferred."
      },
      "editorial": {
        "en": {
          "why_it_matters": "Rahman's film music is built for this kind of expansion: Indian classical color, electronics, pop hooks, choral scale and cinematic orchestration already coexist inside the writing. Putting that language in front of the New Jersey Symphony makes the arrangement itself the reason to listen, not celebrity or soundtrack nostalgia. The interesting question is how themes from very different periods and film traditions change when a full orchestra carries the weight, counterpoint and dynamic range in the room.",
          "trip_verdict": "Actively make room for one of the two Newark performances if orchestration, Indian film music and large-scale cross-genre writing are in the listening thread. It can anchor a Newark/NYC evening, while the two-night run and the broader Symphonic Experience activity provide enough flexibility that it need not displace a genuinely singular event elsewhere in the corridor.",
          "listen_before": "A.R. Rahman — Bombay (Original Soundtrack) [OST]"
        },
        "es": {
          "why_it_matters": "La música de cine de Rahman está hecha para este tipo de expansión: color de tradición clásica india, electrónica, hooks de pop, escala coral y escritura cinematográfica ya conviven dentro de sus composiciones. Poner ese lenguaje frente a la New Jersey Symphony hace que el arreglo sea la razón para escuchar, no la celebridad ni la nostalgia de soundtrack. La pregunta interesante es cómo cambian temas de épocas y películas muy distintas cuando una orquesta completa carga con el peso, el contrapunto y el rango dinámico dentro de la sala.",
          "trip_verdict": "Sí le haría espacio activamente a una de las dos funciones en Newark si la orquestación, la música de cine india y la escritura cross-genre a gran escala están en el hilo de escucha. Puede anclar una noche Newark/NYC, mientras las dos funciones y la actividad más amplia de Symphonic Experience dejan suficiente flexibilidad para no desplazar un evento verdaderamente singular en otro punto del corredor.",
          "listen_before": "A.R. Rahman — Bombay (Original Soundtrack) [OST]"
        }
      }
    },
