        "Duo Andalus: Ofer Ronen — oud / flamenco guitar"
      ],
      "factual_description": "NJPAC presents Mariza with special guests Derek Gripper and Duo Andalus in Prudential Hall on Sunday, November 1, 2026 at 6:00 PM. NJPAC describes Mariza's set as a journey through Portuguese fado across her career; Derek Gripper appears with his African-guitar repertoire, while Duo Andalus pairs Lala Tamar's vocals with Ofer Ronen on oud and flamenco guitar in music drawing on Mediterranean and Middle Eastern traditions. NJPAC describes Gripper and Duo Andalus as two performances that set the stage for Mariza rather than announcing a joint collaboration among all artists. Ticketmaster independently confirms the same date, time and billing.",
      "links": {
        "official_event": "https://www.njpac.org/event/mariza-2026/",
        "official_tickets": "https://www.ticketmaster.com/mariza-with-special-guests-derek-gripper-newark-new-jersey-11-01-2026/event/0000645AEB758995"
      },
