        "status": "complete",
        "missing": [],
        "note": "Exact NJPAC event, authorized Ticketmaster destination, announced personnel for Duo Andalus and exact Apple Music pages for Mariza and Derek Gripper are verified. The editorial copy does not imply that the three acts will collaborate because NJPAC describes Gripper and Duo Andalus as performances that set the stage for Mariza."
      },
